<title>GERMANY: German March wholesale prices rise 0.8 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German March wholesale prices rise 0.8 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE PRICES	Mar 97	Feb 96	 Mar 96</p>
<p> Monthly change		    +0.8	   +0.3	   +0.5</p>
<p> Yearly change		     +1.6	   +1.4	   -1.1</p>
<p> Index (basis 1991)	     105.0	  104.2	  103.3</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, +49 228 26097150</p>
